      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38512,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Doorstop \u00b7 The same files \u00b7 accept the `reqs/**/` tree as the register's declared home\nrather than annotating existing product docs \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low \u2014 it is a parallel layout\nby design and cannot annotate `docs/product/<slug>.md` at all \u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Doorstop \u00b7 The same files \u00b7 accept the `reqs/**/` tree as the register's declared home\nrather than annotating existing product docs \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low \u2014 it is a parallel layout\nby design and cannot annotate `docs/product/<slug>.md` at all \u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1425",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1949,
      "width": 574.2,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0425",
      "seed": 19975,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38525,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Doorstop \u00b7 Claude Code friendly \u00b7 give the model the exact filename convention and the\nper-document `.doorstop.yml`, so capture is a Write to a computable path \u00b7 permanent \u00b7\nmedium \u2014 the UID is the filename, so the model must compute the next free number before\nwriting \u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Doorstop \u00b7 Claude Code friendly \u00b7 give the model the exact filename convention and the\nper-document `.doorstop.yml`, so capture is a Write to a computable path \u00b7 permanent \u00b7\nmedium \u2014 the UID is the filename, so the model must compute the next free number before\nwriting \u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1426",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2021,
      "width": 587.4000000000001,
      "height": 45.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0426",
      "seed": 19982,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38538,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Doorstop \u00b7 The producer's ID format \u00b7 pass `-s -` on every document creation; the default\nseparator is empty and yields `UX001` \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 high \u2014 verified hands-on, `FUN-001`\nand `UX-001` both produced verbatim \u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Doorstop \u00b7 The producer's ID format \u00b7 pass `-s -` on every document creation; the default\nseparator is empty and yields `UX001` \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 high \u2014 verified hands-on, `FUN-001`\nand `UX-001` both produced verbatim \u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1427",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2078,
      "width": 594.0,
      "height": 45.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0427",
      "seed": 19989,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38551,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Doorstop \u00b7 The twenty-category taxonomy \u00b7 model the twenty categories as one document each\nunder a single synthetic root, since a second root document is rejected \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low\n\u2014 the tree is single-rooted by design and a flat taxonomy is not expressible natively \u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Doorstop \u00b7 The twenty-category taxonomy \u00b7 model the twenty categories as one document each\nunder a single synthetic root, since a second root document is rejected \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low\n\u2014 the tree is single-rooted by design and a flat taxonomy is not expressible natively \u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1428",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2135,
      "width": 594.0,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0428",
      "seed": 19996,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38564,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Doorstop \u00b7 The five-state lifecycle \u00b7 validate the state field with Kerd's own checker,\nbecause Doorstop does not validate custom attribute values \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 high \u2014 `state:\nBANANA_NOT_A_LIFECYCLE_STATE` passed the strictest run, so the gap is measured and the fix\nis ours \u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Doorstop \u00b7 The five-state lifecycle \u00b7 validate the state field with Kerd's own checker,\nbecause Doorstop does not validate custom attribute values \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 high \u2014 `state:\nBANANA_NOT_A_LIFECYCLE_STATE` passed the strictest run, so the gap is measured and the fix\nis ours \u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1429",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2207,
      "width": 594.0,
