      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Doorstop \u00b7 Category disposition \u00b7 a custom `disposition` attribute plus a Kerd-side\ncompleteness check \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 high \u2014 custom attributes are preserved and can carry per-\ndocument defaults \u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Doorstop \u00b7 Category disposition \u00b7 a custom `disposition` attribute plus a Kerd-side\ncompleteness check \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 high \u2014 custom attributes are preserved and can carry per-\ndocument defaults \u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
