      "originalText": "Doorstop \u00b7 Quality \u00b7 validate every custom value with Kerd's own checker, since Doorstop\nvalidates none of them \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 high \u2014 `state: BANANA_NOT_A_LIFECYCLE_STATE` passed\nits strictest run, so the gap is measured \u00b7 \u2014",
