      "text": "Doorstop \u00b7 Rating \u00b7 adopt only the markdown itemformat \u2014 frontmatter plus body \u2014 and none\nof the tool \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 high \u2014 a stdlib script parsed every field with PyYAML *not*\ninstalled, so the idea travels without the dependency \u00b7 \u2014",
